    {
      "source": "Concrete <a href=\"api/BaseAdvisorChain.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api\"><code>BaseAdvisorChain</code></a> classes must override this to return the most\nconcrete builder implementation.",
      "translation": "具体实现 <a href=\"api/BaseAdvisorChain.html\" title=\"org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api 中的接口\"><code>BaseAdvisorChain</code></a> 的类必须重写此方法，以返回最具体的构建器实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default implementation for the <a href=\"api/BaseAdvisorChain.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api\"><code>BaseAdvisorChain</code></a>. Used by the <a href=\"../ChatClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient</code></a>\nto delegate the call to the next <a href=\"api/CallAdvisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api\"><code>CallAdvisor</code></a> or <a href=\"api/StreamAdvisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api\"><code>StreamAdvisor</code></a> in the\nchain.",
      "translation": "这是<a href=\"api/BaseAdvisorChain.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api\"><code>BaseAdvisorChain</code></a>的默认实现。它被<a href=\"../ChatClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client\"><code>ChatClient</code></a>使用，用于将调用委托给链中的下一个<a href=\"api/CallAdvisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api\"><code>CallAdvisor</code></a>或<a href=\"api/StreamAdvisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.chat.client.advisor.api\"><code>StreamAdvisor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
